Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:24:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1166/1179] HERESY 1167: the LoRA picker: Sound, together; a
 two-file adapter as one; mute by a right-click; out of the list to its
 Trainer run; the trigger words by themselves; the logo's cloud lighter
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, the night of 05.10.2026, over his four Buratino tests with the Chonishvili reading voice:
· «Там, где у тебя ползунок music, together, нужно добавить также ползунок sound, together»: the sound half's together
  beside the music's (by ear: two adapters at sound 1.0 each, 2.0 together, gave the heavy bass; 0.55 together sounded
  right; green to 1, amber to 1.5), dragged to move all the sound strengths at once.
· «Epic Trailer… предлагается как два разных адаптера… объедини их… MUSIC+SOUND=BOTH»: a music-only file and a sound-only
  file of one name are one card (BOTH), one row with its two strengths and one ✕; the hints count them once.
· «по правому клику мыши Mute/Пропустить… Unmute/Вернуть в строй»: a muted adapter stays in the form with its strengths and
  is left out of the run and of both totals; the form keeps it muted across a reload.
· «адаптер из локального тренинга… Убрать из списка (адаптер в своей сессии Тренера)»: on an adapter trained here, by a
  right-click: out of loras/, its checkpoint still in its run (the Trainer puts it back).
· «суффиксом приклинивай все триггеры в системный промпт… кнопка не нужна… веса накладываются не триггером»: the adapters'
  trigger words go at the style's end in the request by themselves (the field stays as written, a word in it is not
  doubled, a muted adapter adds none); the row says the word instead of «+ word».
· «По Деве сделай 0.45… но и 0.6 тоже заверши»: the cloud under the Maiden at 0.45 (a page variable, --logo-cloud).

cdp-console 335/0/7, check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
